# Key material. The age identity that decrypts nix/secrets/*.yaml lives in
# ~/.config/sops/age/keys.txt and must never land in this repo -- committing it
# would publish every secret it protects the moment this is pushed. A backstop,
# not the mechanism: the key is kept outside the repo in the first place.
keys.txt
*.agekey
id_ed25519
id_rsa
*.pem
